OL,3,GNEWSAFamily courts deal with 41 cases
OL,4,Ain abuse inquiry
OL,5,
OL,6,FFamily courts are dealing with 41 cases
OL,7,Finvolving children at the centre of an
OL,8,Fongoing safeguarding investigation,
OL,9,Fnewly published court rulings have
OL,10,Frevealed.
OL,12,FThe cases relate to children found
OL,13,Fliving at Webb House in Crewe,
OL,14,Fheadquarters of the Ahmadi Religion of
OL,15,FPeace and Light (AROPL).
OL,17,FCheshire Police officers raided the
OL,18,Fsite in April as part of an
OL,19,Finvestigation into allegations
OL,20,Fincluding forced marriage and modern
OL,21,Fslavery. Thirteen people remain on
OL,22,Fconditional bail.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,359,350,200,160,0,100
