OL,3,GNEWSAFamily courts deal with 41 cases
OL,4,Ain abuse inquiry
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn a ruling published on Tuesday, Mr
OL,7,FJustice Hayden said interim care orders
OL,8,Fwere made for children living at Webb
OL,9,FHouse, although the "overwhelming
OL,10,Fmajority" remained living with a parent
OL,11,For other family member.
